Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Bridge browser input and navigation

Integrates the abrowser input handling and navigation with
headless Chromium. This patch:
1. Calls abrowser::Renderer::Main() early in startup
2. Sets up input thread listening for terminal events
3. Forwards navigation and focus events to/from the browser
---
